! version = 2.0

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Team contact sync — _common/ (loaded for ALL personas)
//
//  A team member asks for their team's contact directory and the
//  gateway emails it back as a .vcf attachment.
//
//  NOT RBAC-gated in macro_bridge: any team member may request
//  their OWN team's directory. The gateway authorizes on `Team: *`
//  RapidPro group membership and refuses everyone else.
//
//  The printed QR code resolves to a WhatsApp chat that sends
//  "sync" — so scanning it lands on the bare trigger below.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

+ sync
- <call>macro_sync</call>

+ kontak
- <call>macro_sync</call>

+ contacts
- <call>macro_sync</call>

// Named team: "sync alpha" / "kontak alpha"
+ sync *
- <call>macro_sync <star></call>

+ kontak *
- <call>macro_sync <star></call>

+ contacts *
- <call>macro_sync <star></call>

// Operator only: deliver pending directory updates to every member now,
// instead of waiting for the daily check. Gated twice: ADMIN_MACROS here, and
// the gateway's operator-only `config` toolset. Deliberately not starting
// with sync/kontak/contacts, so it can never be read as a directory request.
+ push contacts
- <call>macro_sync_push</call>
+ voye kontak
- <call>macro_sync_push</call>

// Operator only: close an ICT request ticket, e.g. "ferme 12 câble remplacé".
+ ferme *
- <call>macro_ict_close <star></call>
+ fèmen *
- <call>macro_ict_close <star></call>
+ close ticket *
- <call>macro_ict_close <star></call>
